blurb: The school board discussed the FY27 budget, incorporating recent health insurance
  savings to reinstate some teaching and support staff positions while addressing
  concerns about financial stability and contingency funds. Public comment was dominated
  by strong opinions regarding the elementary school reconfiguration plan, its unclear
  costs, and perceived lack of transparency, culminating in a contentious vote to
  advance the budget to the City Council.
